<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <Title>Portamical</Title>
    <Version>2.1.0</Version>
    <Authors>CsabaDu</Authors>
    <Company>CsabaDu</Company>
    <Description>Shared utilities and base classes for cross‑framework test data solutions in .NET, built on the Portamical.Core data model.</Description>
    <Copyright>(c) 2026. Csaba Dudas (CsabaDu)</Copyright>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/CsabaDu/Portamical/tree/master/Portamical</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>test; unittest; testdata; frameworkagnostic; portable; dynamicdata; datadriven; mstest; nunit; xunit; xunitv3;</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>v2.1.0 - 2026-04-20
Added
- Generic Equality&lt;T&gt;() method with custom comparison delegate
- Built-in Equality() method supporting 22+ types with pattern matching
- Floating-point tolerance support (configurable epsilon)
- Collection equality with recursive element comparison
- Special value handling for NaN, infinities, and signed zeros
- BigInteger equality support
- ToDistinctReadOnly() parameterless overload
Changed
- IsTypeOf() now accepts nullable actual parameter (breaking change)
- Improved floating-point comparison with bitwise equality checks
- Enhanced null handling in generic methods
Fixed
- Floating-point precision issues (0.1 + 0.2 now equals 0.3)
- Collection comparison with nested structures</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\icon.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="..\LICENSE.txt">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Portamical.Core" Version="2.0.1" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
